HOW TO GET THE COMPLETE LIST

From a checkout of this repository:

  go list -m all                      # every module and version in the build
  go install github.com/google/go-licenses@latest
  go-licenses report ./cmd/...        # module, license URL and license name
  go-licenses save ./cmd/... --save_path=third_party_licenses
                                      # copies all license texts

Releases also ship an SPDX SBOM for every archive (*.spdx.json), which lists
the bundled packages.

The distroless base image of the server container image
(gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12) has its own licenses; see the image
documentation.
